# Glossary

One term per card, so any card can transclude a definition without pulling in
its neighbours.

- [[token]] — the credential itself
- [[idempotency]] — not yet written

`[[idempotency]]` is a **red link**: no card claims that name anywhere in the
tree. It lints as HMD001, a warning rather than an error, which is what makes it
a work item instead of a build failure.
